===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|music}} To generate the high-frequency sound by allowing a speaker to cause vibration of the sound generator of a musical instrument connected by an amplifier to the speaker.
#: {{ux|en|The show ended with a riot of '''feedbacking''' guitars.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To provide informational feedback to.
#: {{ux|en|His employees '''feedbacked''' him a lot more than he wanted.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To convey by means of specialized communications channel.
#: {{ux|en|Customers '''feedbacked''' their complaints and some praise.}}

====Usage notes====
* Some are likely to prefer {{m|en|feed back}} and its inflected forms ''feeds back'', ''feeding back''{{,}} or ''fed back''.

